# Leading Dot Decimals
# Numbers without a leading zero: .5 is equivalent to 0.5

## Bare leading-dot number
.5

## Assignment
a = .5
b = .5 tomatoes

## Arithmetic
.5 + .5
.5 * 2
.5 - .25

## With units
.5 tomatoes
.75 cups

## Adjacent units
.5kg
.25lb

## Multipliers
.5k
.5M
.5B
.5T

## Percentage
.5%

## Scientific notation
.5e3

## Unary operators
-.5
+.5

## Currency
$.5
